  "claim_short": "For every p>2, recurrence of all link components does **not** imply that the boundary operator has the complex property on ell^p. A single weighted augmented half-line works for every such p: the edge from v_(n-1) to v_n has weight n, and the edge cochain has value 1/n. Its weighted ell^p norm is sum n^(1-p)<infinity, while it carries constant unit flux to infinity. Its boundary is the nonzero endpoint charge, so...",
